SUMMARY:Fireflies Over the Prairie
DESCRIPTION:The fireflies can be so beautiful over the prairie! Join us for an introduction to fireflies followed by firefly observation and an up close look at these amazing insects. We’ll also collect data for a collaborative science project\, so you’ll help contribute data to an important national research project! \nWear closed toed shoes and bring a flashlight to this program – it will be dark when you leave and we have limited lights. \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/fireflies-over-the-prairie-2/
